# Everything text is stored and checked out with LF. The modules' shell scripts run on Android,
# where CRLF line endings break them, so this must hold even on Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit, in case text detection ever guesses wrong.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.prop text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary formats, should any ever be added (screenshots for docs).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
